{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52020","headline":"端坐咏思 · 王绩","name":"端坐咏思","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"张衡赋《四愁》，梁鸿歌《五噫》。\n慷慨□□□，憔悴将焉如？\n纷吾独无闷，高卧喜闲居。\n世途何足数，人事本来虚。\n三王无定策，五帝有残书。\n咄嗟建城市，倏忽观丘墟。\n明治若不足，昏暴常有余。\n寄言忘怀者，归来任卷舒。\n（按：《野客丛书》卷二十录「咄嗟建城市」一句。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52020.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52020","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}